NOTE ON MODEL LICENCES

This tool orchestrates third-party models that carry their own terms:

  * Meta TRIBE v2 (facebook/tribev2, facebook/tribev2-mini) is released under
    CC BY-NC 4.0 — NON-COMMERCIAL use only. Using it to optimise commercial
    advertising is arguably outside that licence. This is your decision to make,
    not this tool's.
  * TRIBE's language pathway uses meta-llama/Llama-3.2-1B, a gated repository
    requiring licence acceptance and a HuggingFace token.

The MIT licence above covers this tool's own source code only.
